# Restorations (Enhancements > Restorations, port/include/port/restorations.h).
#
# Rogueport's chalk outline, for a player with no Japanese disc in the launcher's library
# (port/settings/features/chalk_outline.cpp): the shape the outline is traced round. Mario's own
# arms-out picture on the disc (a/a_mario- 3, the one he throws his arms wide in), its opaque texels
# filled white, and grown 2 texels so the gap between his legs and the notches in his gloves close
# up: one solid shape whose outer edge the game traces, simplifies, and draws as a chalk-white strip
# on the house's floor, where the Japanese release's outline lies. Only the US and European discs
# need it (the Japanese one has the outline).

image art/restorations/chalk_body.png
  discs G8ME01 G8MP01
  load model a_mario 3
  alpha cut 128
  fill where a>=128 #ffffff
  grow 2 #ffffff
end
